#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kturtle; is an educational programming environment that uses <link linkend="
"\"what-is-turtlelang\">&turtlescript;</link>, a programming language loosely "
"based on and inspired by &logo;. The goal of &kturtle; is to make "
"programming as easy and accessible as possible. This makes &kturtle; "
"suitable for teaching kids the basics of math, geometry and... programming. "
"One of the main features of &turtlescript; is the ability to translate the "
"commands into the speaking language of the programmer."
msgstr ""
"&kturtle; je jedno obrazovno okruženje za programiranjeis koje koristi <link "
"linkend=\"what-is-turtlelang\">&turtlescript;</link>, prograski jezik koji "
"se labavo zasniva na i inspirisan je &logo;. Cilj &kturtle; je da učini "
"programiranje što je moguće jednostavnijim i dostupnijim. Ovo čini &kturtle; "
"pogodnim za poučavanje djece osnovama matematike, gometrije i .. "
"programiranja. Jedna od glavnih odlika &turtlescript; je sposobnost da "
"prevode komande u govorni jezik programera."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kturtle; is named after <quote>the turtle</quote> that plays a central role "
"in the programming environment. The student will usually instruct the "
"turtle, using the &turtlescript; commands, to make a drawing on <link "
"linkend=\"the-canvas\">the canvas</link>."
msgstr ""
"&kturtle; dobio je ime po <quote>the turtle</quote> koji igra centralnu "
"ulogu u programskom okruženju. Učenik će obično davati instrukcije kornjači "
"koristeći &turtlescript; komande, praviti crtež na <link linkend=\"the-canvas"
"\">the canvas</link>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "What is &turtlescript;?"
msgstr "Šta je &turtlescript;?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&turtlescript;, the programming language used in &kturtle;, is inspired by "
"the &logo; family of programming languages. The first version of &logo; was "
"created by Seymour Papert of MIT Artificial Intelligence Laboratory in 1967 "
"as an offshoot of the LISP programming language. From then many versions of "
"&logo; have been released. By 1980 &logo; was gaining momentum, with "
"versions for MSX, Commodore, Atari, Apple II and IBM PC systems. These "
"versions were mainly for educational purposes. The MIT is still maintains "
"<ulink url=\"http://el.media.mit.edu/logo-foundation/\">a website on &logo;</"
"ulink> containing a list of several popular implementation of the language."
msgstr ""
"&turtlescript;, programski jezik korišten u &kturtle;, inspirisan je sa "
"&logo; porodicom programskih jezika. Prva verzija &logo; napravljena je od "
"strane Seymour Papert sa MIT Laboratorije Vještačke Inteligencije 1967 kao "
"izdanak programskog jezika LISP. Otada je izdato mnogo verzija &logo;. Do "
"1980 &logo; je dobijala zamah sa verzijama za MSX, Commodore, Atari, Apple "
"II i IBM PC sisteme. Ove verzije su bile uglavnom za obrazovne svrhe.  MIT "
"još održava <ulink url=\"http://el.media.mit.edu/logo-foundation/\"> web "
"stranicu na &logo;</ulink> koja sadrži listu nekoliko popularnih primjena "
"jezika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&turtlescript; shares a feature found in many other implementations of "
"&logo;: the ability to translate the commands to suit the native language of "
"the student. This feature makes it easier for students that have no or "
"little understanding of English to get started. Besides this feature "
"&kturtle; has <link linkend=\"features-of-kturtle\">many other features</"
"link> aimed at easing the students initial experience with programming."
msgstr ""
"&turtlescript; dijeli odliku koja se sreće u mnogim drugim implementacijama "
"&logo;: sposobnost da prevode komande da odgovaraju maternjem jeziku "
"učenika. Ova odlika čini jednostavnijim početak za učenike koji ne razumiju "
"ili malo razumiju engleski. Pored ove odlike &kturtle; ima <link linkend="
"\"features-of-kturtle\">mnoge druge odlike</link> usmjerene na olakšavanju "
"učenicima početno iskustvo sa programiranjem."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid "Features of &kturtle;"
msgstr "Odlike &kturtle;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kturtle; has some nice features that make starting to program a breeze. See "
"here some of the highlights of &kturtle; feature set:"
msgstr ""
"&kturtle; ima neke lijepe odlike koje čine lakim počinjanje sa programom. "
"Pogledajte ovdje neke od najznačajnijih &kturtle; setova odlika:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An integrated environment with &turtlescript; interpreter, <link linkend="
"\"the-editor\">editor</link>, <link linkend=\"the-canvas\">canvas</link> and "
"other tools all in one application (no extra dependencies)."
msgstr ""
"Integrisano okruženje sa &turtlescript; prevodilac, <link linkend=\"the-"
"editor\">uređivač</link>, <link linkend=\"the-canvas\">platno</link> i drugi "
"alati sve u jednoj primjeni (bez dodatnih zavisnosti)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The ability to translate the &turtlescript; commands using the translation "
"framework of &kde;."
msgstr ""
"Sposobnost da prevodi &turtlescript; komande koristeći okvir za prevođenje "
"&kde;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&turtlescript; supports user defined functions, recursion and dynamic type "
"switching."
msgstr ""
"&turtlescript; podržava funkcije definisane od strane korisnika, rekurziju i "
"prebacivanje dinamičkog tipa."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid "The execution can be slowed down, paused or stopped at any time."
msgstr ""
"Izvršenje može biti usporeno, zaustavljeno ili prekinuto u bilo koje vrijeme."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A powerful <link linkend=\"the-editor\">editor</link> featuring intuitive "
"syntax highlighting, line numbering, error markers, visual execution and "
"more."
msgstr ""
"Snažni <link linkend=\"the-editor\">editor</link> sadrži intuitivno "
"isticanje sintakse, numeraciju redova, markere grešaka, vizualno izvršenje i "
"više.  featuring intuitive syntax highlighting, line numbering, error "
"markers, visual execution and more."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <link linkend=\"the-canvas\">canvas</link>, where the turtle draws, can "
"be printed or saved either as an image (PNG) or a drawing (SVG)."
msgstr ""
"<link linkend=\"the-canvas\">canvas</link>, gdje kornjača dovuče, može biti "
"štampan ili snimljen bilo kao slika (PNG) ili crtež (SVG)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Context help: help where you need it. Just press <keysym>F2</keysym> (or see "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Help</guimenu><guimenuitem>Help on: ...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>) to get help on the piece of code currently under your cursor."
msgstr ""
"Kontekst pomoći: pomoć gdje vam je potrebna. Samo pritisnite <keysym>F2</"
"keysym> (ili pogledajte <menuchoice><guimenu>Pomoć</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Pomoć za: ...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>) kako bi "
"dobili pomoć na dijelu koda oji je trenutno pod vašim kursorom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An error dialog that links the error messages to the mistakes in the program "
"and marks them red."
msgstr ""
"Dijalog grešaka koji povezuje poruke o greškama sa greškama u programu i "
"označava ih crveno."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid "Simplified programming terminology."
msgstr "Pojednostavljena terminologija programiranja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Integrated example programs to make it easy to get started. These examples "
"are translated using &kde; translation framework."
msgstr ""
"Integrisani primjer programa da pojednostave početak. Ovi primjeri su "
"prevedeni koristeći &kde; okvir za prevođenje."

